      <marc:subfield code="a">This book offers a comprehensive and accessible overview of five great Tamil epics: Silappadhikaram, Manimekalai, Seevaka Sinthamani, Valliyapathi, and the tales of Kundalakesi. Each epic is presented in two sections: the first provides a concise summary of the story, while the second delves into historical context, the book&apos;s background, character development, and notable features. Aimed at both students and general readers, this work simplifies these classic Tamil narratives, making them easily understandable and engaging for a broader audience.</marc:subfield>
